{
  "info": {
    "name": "Ongaku - Carrito, Ordenes y Resenas",
    "description": "Flujo completo de prueba para carrito de compras, ordenes y resenas.\n\nCOMO USARLA:\n1) Anda a la pestana Variables de esta coleccion y confirma que baseUrl apunte a tu servidor (por defecto http://localhost:8080).\n2) Ejecuta las carpetas EN ORDEN: 0. Setup -> 1. Carrito -> 2. Ordenes -> 3. Resenas. Cada request usa el resultado del anterior (tokens e ids se guardan solos en variables de coleccion).\n3) El registro SIEMPRE crea usuarios con rol USER (por diseno, nadie puede auto-asignarse ADMIN). Para probar los endpoints de admin haces falta:\n   a) Correr el request '0.3 Registrar candidato a admin'.\n   b) Ejecutar a mano en tu base de datos: UPDATE user SET role = 'ADMIN' WHERE email = 'admin@test.com';\n   c) Recien despues correr '0.4 Login admin (despues del UPDATE)'. Ese request verifica solo que el rol haya quedado en ADMIN y te avisa si te olvidaste del paso (b).\n4) Podes correr todo con el boton 'Run' (Collection Runner) una vez que ya hiciste el UPDATE, o request por request con Send.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token_user", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token_user2", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token_admin", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "vinylId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "vinylId2", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "orderId2", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "orderId3", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "reviewId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Setup",
      "description": "Crea los dos usuarios de prueba, promueve uno a ADMIN a mano en la base y carga un vinilo con el que vas a operar en las carpetas siguientes.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0.1 Registrar comprador",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"comprador@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"clave1234\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Ana\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Comprador\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"] },
            "description": "Registra al usuario que va a usar el carrito, hacer ordenes y escribir resenas. El carrito vacio se crea solo, en el mismo paso."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('registro OK (o ya existia)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect([200, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token_user', pm.response.json()['access token']);",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.warn('comprador@test.com ya existia; corre 0.1b (login) si necesitas refrescar el token');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "0.1b Login comprador (si ya existia)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"comprador@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"clave1234\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/authenticate", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "authenticate"] },
            "description": "Usa este request solo si 0.1 te devolvio 409 (el usuario ya estaba registrado de una corrida anterior)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('login OK', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token_user', pm.response.json()['access token']);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "0.2 Registrar segundo usuario (ownership)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"comprador2@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"clave1234\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Bruno\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Otro\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"] },
            "description": "Este usuario sirve para probar que nadie puede tocar el carrito, las ordenes o las resenas de otra persona."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('registro OK (o ya existia)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect([200, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token_user2', pm.response.json()['access token']);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "0.3 Registrar candidato a admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"clave1234\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Root\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Admin\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"] },
            "description": "Se registra como USER (no hay forma de pedir ADMIN por API, es intencional). El siguiente paso es promoverlo a mano en la base."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('registro OK (o ya existia)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect([200, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "console.log('Ahora corre en tu base de datos: UPDATE user SET role = \\'ADMIN\\' WHERE email = \\'admin@test.com\\';');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "0.4 Login admin (despues del UPDATE)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"clave1234\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/authenticate", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "authenticate"] },
            "description": "IMPORTANTE: antes de correr esto, ejecuta en tu base:\nUPDATE user SET role = 'ADMIN' WHERE email = 'admin@test.com';\nEl login siempre funciona aunque no hayas hecho el UPDATE, pero el rol quedaria en USER y el siguiente request (0.5) te lo va a marcar en rojo con un mensaje claro."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('login OK', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token_admin', pm.response.json()['access token']);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "0.5 Verificar que el rol quedo en ADMIN",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users", "me"] },
            "description": "Chequeo de sanidad: si esto falla, es porque falta el UPDATE SQL del paso 0.4 (o corriste el login antes del UPDATE). Volve a loguear con 0.4 despues de actualizar la base."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('el usuario admin@test.com tiene rol ADMIN', function () {",
                  "    var role = pm.response.json().data.role;",
                  "    pm.expect(role, 'Rol actual: ' + role + '. Corre el UPDATE SQL y volve a hacer login en 0.4').to.eql('ADMIN');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "0.6 Crear vinilo de prueba (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Abbey Road\",\n  \"description\": \"Edicion de prueba\",\n  \"price\": 15000,\n  \"stock\": 10,\n  \"year\": 1969\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/vinyls", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["admin", "vinyls"] },
            "description": "Este vinilo (vinylId) se usa en las carpetas de Carrito y Ordenes."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('vinilo creado', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('vinylId', pm.response.json().data.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Carrito",
      "description": "Agregar, modificar cantidad, eliminar y ver los totales del carrito. Cada usuario opera unicamente sobre su propio carrito.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Ver mi carrito (vacio)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_user}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/carts", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["carts"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('el carrito arranca vacio', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.empty).to.eql(true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 Agregar un producto",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_user}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"vinylId\": {{vinylId}},\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/carts/items", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["carts", "items"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('cantidad = 2', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.items[0].quantity).to.eql(2);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 Agregar el mismo producto de nuevo (acumula)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_user}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"vinylId\": {{vinylId}},\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/carts/items", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["carts", "items"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('sigue habiendo una sola linea', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.items.length).to.eql(1);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('la cantidad se acumulo a 3', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.items[0].quantity).to.eql(3);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.4 Modificar la cantidad",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_user}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"quantity\": 5\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/carts/items/{{vinylId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["carts", "items", "{{vinylId}}"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK y cantidad = 5', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.items[0].quantity).to.eql(5);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.5 Pedir mas cantidad que el stock disponible",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_user}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"quantity\": 999\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/carts/items/{{vinylId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["carts", "items", "{{vinylId}}"] },
            "description": "El vinilo de prueba tiene stock 10: pedir 999 tiene que rechazarse."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('409 Conflict por falta de stock', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(409); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.6 Sacar el producto del carrito",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_user}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/carts/items/{{vinylId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["carts", "items", "{{vinylId}}"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK y el carrito queda vacio', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.items.length).to.eql(0);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.7 Volver a agregar (lo vamos a comprar despues)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_user}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"vinylId\": {{vinylId}},\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/carts/items", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["carts", "items"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.8 Otro usuario no puede tocar este carrito",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_user2}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"quantity\": 3\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/carts/items/{{vinylId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["carts", "items", "{{vinylId}}"] },
            "description": "comprador2 no tiene este vinilo en SU carrito (cada usuario opera solo sobre el propio), asi que da 404, no 403."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('404: el vinilo no esta en el carrito de este usuario', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Ordenes",
      "description": "Checkout desde el carrito, consulta de ordenes propias, y las reglas de cambio de estado (usuario vs admin).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 Checkout (crear orden desde el carrito)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_user}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["orders"] },
            "description": "Sin body: la orden se arma sola con lo que haya en el carrito y nace PENDIENTE."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "var data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "pm.test('nace PENDIENTE', function () { pm.expect(data.orderStatus.name).to.eql('PENDIENTE'); });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', data.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 Verificar que el carrito quedo vacio",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_user}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/carts", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["carts"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('el carrito quedo vacio tras el checkout', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.empty).to.eql(true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.3 Ver el detalle de la orden",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_user}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["orders", "{{orderId}}"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('200 OK', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"] }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.4 Ver todas mis ordenes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_user}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["orders"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('200 OK', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"] }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.5 Admin intenta saltear un estado (debe fallar)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"ENTREGADA\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["orders", "{{orderId}}", "status"] },
            "description": "No se puede pasar de PENDIENTE a ENTREGADA sin pasar por PAGADA y ENVIADA."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('409 Conflict', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(409); });"] }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.6 Usuario intenta marcarla PAGADA (debe fallar)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_user}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"PAGADA\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["orders", "{{orderId}}", "status"] },
            "description": "El comprador solo puede cancelar su propia orden PENDIENTE; el resto del flujo logistico es del admin."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('403 Forbidden', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(403); });"] }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.7a Admin: PENDIENTE -> PAGADA",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"PAGADA\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["orders", "{{orderId}}", "status"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK y queda PAGADA', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.orderStatus.name).to.eql('PAGADA');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.7b Admin: PAGADA -> ENVIADA",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"ENVIADA\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["orders", "{{orderId}}", "status"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK y queda ENVIADA', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.orderStatus.name).to.eql('ENVIADA');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.7c Admin: ENVIADA -> ENTREGADA",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
